<HTML>
<HEAD>
  <TITLE>
    eGroups              </TITLE>
      <META content="free email groups, mailing lists, communities, majordomo, e-mail, bounce handling, mlm software, listserv, ONElist, newletters, announcement, email lists, list hosting" name=keywords>
    <META content="eGroups - Free, easy email groups" name=description>
    </HEAD>
<BODY bgColor="#FFFFFF" text="#000000">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
  <tr bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="middle">
    <!-- Logo -->
    <td width="1%" align="center"><img src="/img/logo120.gif" width="120" height="53" vspace="5" hspace="10" border="0" alt="eGroups"></td>
    <td align=center><img src="/img/top.gif" width="468" height="60"> </td>
  </tr>
</table>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">
  <tr align="right" valign="bottom" bgcolor="#FFCC00"> <!-- Greetings --> 
    <td height="25"> <font color="#000000"> <b> </b>&nbsp; </font> </td>
  </tr>
  <tr align="right" valign="bottom"> 
    <td height="25">&nbsp; </td>
  </tr>
  <tr align="center" valign="bottom"> 
    <td height="25"> 
      <table cellpadding="u" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="400">
        <tr> 
          <td align="right" valign="bottom" width="20"><img src="/img/ul.gif" width="20" height="20"></td>
          <td width="360" bgcolor="#9999CC">&nbsp;</td>
          <td align="left" valign="bottom" width="20"><img src="/img/ur.gif" width="20" height="20"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td align="right" valign="bottom" width="20" bgcolor="#9999CC">&nbsp;</td>
          <td width="360" bgcolor="#9999CC"><font color="#FFFFFF"><b><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Dear 
            eGroups Members, </font></b></font> 
            <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b><font color="#FFFFFF">eGroups 
              is undergoing a fixer-upper.</font><font color="#FFFFFF"><br>
              <br>
              The eGroups service will be down for routine database maintenance
              Wednesday September 6 from 11:30 PM to 2 AM PDT. During this time,
              the eGroups Web site will be unavailable and all email will be
              queued. All email sent during this time should be delivered by
              3 AM, but further delays may occur due to backlog. Please do not
              resend email. <br>
              <br>
              I apologize for any inconvience this may cause. </font></b></font><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b><font color="#FFFFFF">Everything 
              will be better when I'm done with it.</font></b></font></p>
            <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b><font color="#FFFFFF">The 
              eGroups Plumber</font></b></font></p>
          </td>
          <td align="left" valign="bottom" width="20" bgcolor="#9999CC">&nbsp;</td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td align="right" valign="top" width="20"><img src="/img/ll.gif" width="20" height="20"></td>
          <td width="360" bgcolor="#9999CC">&nbsp;</td>
          <td align="left" valign="top" width="20"><img src="/img/lr.gif" width="20" height="20"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td colspan="3"> 
            <div align="right"><img src="/img/dialogue.gif" width="200" height="30"></div>
          </td>
